($tpl$request_received$tpl$, $tpl$customer$tpl$, false, $tpl$We're building your website demo, {{first_name}}$tpl$, $tpl$Your free preview is in the works. It can be ready as soon as tomorrow.$tpl$, $tpl$<h1 style="{{st_h1}}">Your free demo is in the works</h1><p style="{{st_p}}">Hi {{first_name}},</p><p style="{{st_p}}">Thanks for asking us to design a preview of the new website for <strong>{{business_name}}</strong>. We've got what we need to get started.</p><p style="{{st_p}}">Your demo can be ready as soon as the next day. When it is, you'll get a link to see it. There's nothing to pay and nothing to sign.</p><p style="{{st_p}}">While you wait, here's the kind of work we do:</p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="{{st_btn_tbl}}"><tr><td bgcolor="#2F6BFF" style="{{st_btn_td}}"><a href="{{site_url}}/#examples" style="{{st_btn_a}}">See recent work</a></td></tr></table>$tpl$, $tpl$Hi {{first_name}},

Thanks for asking us to design a preview of the new website for {{business_name}}. We've got what we need to get started.

